  "files": {},
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Add-one smoothing gives unseen events probability",
    "description": "For context \u201chas\u201d, maximum likelihood assigns zero to unseen \u201crains\u201d. Add-one adds one pseudo-count to each of the nine vocabulary choices, making the denominator 2+9=11: begun and arrived each get 2/11, while rains gets 1/11."
  }
}
